# Editor configuration, indented to four spaces to match every other
# component's .vscode/ and the workspace file at the repository root. Prettier
# would reindent it to two and single this component out.
.vscode/

# Markdown is formatted by hand, to the conventions in the repository's
# CLAUDE.md: two blank lines before a heading, and paragraphs written as one
# long line rather than hard-wrapped. Prettier disagrees with both — it
# collapses the blank lines and, with proseWrap left alone, reflows nothing
# while still rewriting list markers and emphasis. Keeping it away from .md
# is simpler than fighting it.
*.md
